# Rhox Faithmender: "Lifelink" and "If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead." On turn 3 it attacks
# and its 1 combat damage gains Bot1 1 life by lifelink, doubled to 2 (20 -> 22); Bot1's Lightning Helix then gains 3,
# doubled to 6 (22 -> 28). Bot2's own Lightning Helix on turn 4 gains Bot2 3 life, not doubled: "you" is the
# Faithmender's controller (20 - 1 - 3 + 3 = 19), and deals Bot1 3 (28 -> 25).

